#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:7
msgid "Get Started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:10
msgid "Use development mode"
msgstr "使用开发模式"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:13
msgid ""
"Run the Python backend and Vite frontend separately while changing the web "
"application, then verify the static production path before finishing."
msgstr "修改 Web 应用时分别运行 Python 后端和 Vite 前端，完成前再验证静态生产路径。"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:17
msgid "Start both development servers"
msgstr "启动两个开发服务器"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:19
msgid "Activate the Python environment and start the backend in one terminal:"
msgstr "在一个终端中激活 Python 环境并启动后端："

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:25
msgid "Start Vite in a second terminal and tell it which backend port to proxy:"
msgstr "在第二个终端中启动 Vite，并指定要代理的后端端口："

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:31
msgid ""
"Open `http://127.0.0.1:5173/`. Requests under `/api/` are proxied to the "
"backend on port 8042. A Vite page without a running backend can render the "
"shell while application data and training actions fail, so verify "
"`/api/health` first."
msgstr ""
"打开 `http://127.0.0.1:5173/`。`/api/` 下的请求会代理到 8042 端口的后端。没有运行后端的 Vite "
"页面可以渲染外壳，但应用数据和训练操作会失败，因此应先验证 `/api/health`。"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:35
msgid "Choose the right loop"
msgstr "选择合适的循环"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:12
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "工作流"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:12
msgid "Frontend"
msgstr "前端"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:12
msgid "Use it for"
msgstr "适用场景"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:12
msgid "Development"
msgstr "开发"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:12
msgid "Vite on port 5173"
msgstr "5173 端口上的 Vite"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:12
msgid "Fast feedback and hot module replacement"
msgstr "快速反馈和热模块替换"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:12
msgid "Production-like"
msgstr "类生产环境"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:12
msgid "Static `frontend/dist` served by `app.py`"
msgstr "由 `app.py` 提供的静态 `frontend/dist`"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:12
msgid "Final integration and packaging checks"
msgstr "最终集成与打包检查"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:42
msgid ""
"Backend-only changes do not require Vite. Frontend changes should be checked"
" in both loops because proxy behavior can hide a stale or missing static "
"build."
msgstr "仅后端改动不需要 Vite。前端改动应在两种循环中检查，因为代理行为可能掩盖过期或缺失的静态构建。"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:45
msgid "Return to the static application"
msgstr "返回静态应用"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:47
msgid "Stop Vite, rebuild the checked-in frontend sources, and restart the backend:"
msgstr "停止 Vite，重新构建已提交的前端源代码，然后重启后端："

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:54
msgid ""
"Confirm that the page loads from `http://127.0.0.1:8042/` and that "
"`http://127.0.0.1:8042/api/health` still reports `\"ok\": true`."
msgstr ""
"确认页面从 `http://127.0.0.1:8042/` 加载，且 `http://127.0.0.1:8042/api/health` 仍报告 "
"`\"ok\": true`。"

#: ../../en/get-started/development-mode.md:58
msgid ""
"Binding to `127.0.0.1` keeps the development service on the local machine. "
"Do not expose it to a network until authentication, credentials, and stored "
"research artifacts have been reviewed for that environment."
msgstr "绑定到 `127.0.0.1` 会使开发服务仅保留在本机。在针对该环境审查认证、凭据和已存储研究产物之前，不要将其暴露到网络。"
